From a6ffd5c82942494f7414d84545842ec0388d66bc Mon Sep 17 00:00:00 2001
From: John Merchant <john@johnmerchant.dev>
Date: Fri, 30 Oct 2026 02:23:31 +1030
Subject: [PATCH 4/6] ASoC: add the TSC2100 codec and an i.MX21 machine driver

The codec is the TSC2100 MFD's audio half: I2S master, its PLL run from
MCLK. The machine driver puts it on SSI1 through the AUDMUX, as the
Chumby Classic's 2.6.16 driver did, and switches the speaker with an
optional GPIO.

Claude-Session: https://claude.ai/code/session_01B1fN5Ee1gRFAS7tp8oLbvQ
